  {
    "id": 9,
    "date": "2025-08-12T12:09:41",
    "date_gmt": "2025-08-12T12:09:41",
    "guid": {
      "rendered": "https://guruvayurlive.in/?page_id=9"
    },
    "modified": "2025-08-12T12:09:41",
    "modified_gmt": "2025-08-12T12:09:41",
    "slug": "about",
    "status": "publish",
    "type": "page",
    "link": "https://guruvayurlive.in/about/",
    "title": {
      "rendered": "About"
    },
    "content": {
      "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Welcome to Guruvayur Live, a devotional space dedicated to the sacred Guruvayur Temple and the divine presence of Lord Guruvayurappan. This blog is created with love and devotion, aiming to bring together information, stories, rituals, festivals, and travel tips for pilgrims and devotees alike.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Whether you are planning your first visit or have been visiting Guruvayur for years, our goal is to help you experience the temple more deeply and meaningfully.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Here, you&#8217;ll find:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Daily darshan and pooja timings</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Temple history and legends</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Festival details and dates</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Travel and accommodation guides</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Devotee stories and blog posts</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">I created this blog out of personal devotion and the desire to help others connect with the spiritual essence of Guruvayur. Thank you for being part of this journey!</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n",
      "protected": false
    },
    "excerpt": {
      "rendered": "<p>Welcome to Guruvayur Live, a devotional space dedicated to the sacred Guruvayur Temple and the divine presence of Lord Guruvayurappan. [&hellip;]</p>\n",
      "protected": false
    },
